{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-52-1","title":"Psalms 52:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David, condemning the spitefulness of Doeg, prophesies his destruction. 6 The righteous shall rejoice at it. 8 David, upon his confidence in God's mercy, gives thanks.</p>\n<p>A.M. 2942. B.C. 1062. (Title.) Doeg. 54:3; 1Sa 21:7; 22:9-19 told. 59:7; Jer 9:8; Ex 22:9 boastest. 10:2,3; 94:4; Ro 1:30; 2Ti 3:2 mischief. 7:14; 10:7; 36:3-6; Pr 6:14,18; Isa 59:4; Mic 7:3 O mighty. Ge 6:4,5; 10:8,9; 1Sa 21:7 goodness. 103:17; 107:1; 137:1,2; 1Jo 4:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-2","title":"Psalms 52:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Thy. 50:19; 64:2-6; 140:2,3; Pr 6:16-19; 30:14; Jer 9:3,4; 18:18 Mt 26:59; Ac 6:11-13; 24:1,5; Re 12:10 like. 57:4; 59:7; Pr 12:18; 18:21 working. 109:2; 120:2; 2Co 4:2; 11:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-3","title":"Psalms 52:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>lovest. Jer 4:22; Mic 3:2; Ro 1:25; 2Ti 3:4 lying. 62:4; Jer 9:3-5,8; Joh 8:44; Re 22:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-4","title":"Psalms 52:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>devouring. 1Sa 22:18,19; Jas 3:6-9 O thou. or, and the.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-5","title":"Psalms 52:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>God. 7:14-16; 55:23; 64:7-10; 120:2-4; 140:9-11; Pr 12:19; 19:5,9 Re 21:8 destroy thee. Heb. beat thee down. pluck. 37:35,36; Job 18:14; 20:6,7; Lu 16:27,28 root. Pr 2:22 the land. 27:13; 116:9; Isa 38:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-6","title":"Psalms 52:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>righteous. 37:34; 64:9; 97:8; Job 22:19; Mal 1:5; Re 15:4; 16:5-7; 18:20; 19:1,2 and fear. 40:3; 119:120 laugh. 58:10,11; Isa 37:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-7","title":"Psalms 52:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Lo. Isa 14:16,17; Joh 19:5 made. 146:3-5; Jer 17:5 trusted. 49:6-20; 62:9,10; Job 31:24,25; 1Ti 6:17 strengthened. 73:7-11,18-20; Ec 8:8; Ho 12:7,8 wickedness. or, substance.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-8","title":"Psalms 52:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>like. 1:3; 92:12-14; Jer 11:16; Ho 14:6-8; Ro 11:24 I trust. 13:5; 33:18; 147:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-52-9","title":"Psalms 52:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":52,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":52,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>praise. 145:1,2; 146:2; Eph 3:20,21 wait. 27:14; 40:1; 48:9,10; 62:1,5; 123:2,3; 130:5,6; Pr 18:10; La 3:25,26 for it is. 54:6; 73:25,26,28</p>"}]}